{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "d36e8ad3044e34bb7a64080373fdd7cc3021a1b6a3b65c8d8af46c2563436000", "ja": "光を集めて", "zh": "聚集光芒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f926ee4cbce27aa562fdbae1938b214998865d9aa0c3224117db8c6cec6a76cd", "ja": "科学館の感想を語り合うメンバー達は、\n「月は決して弱いものじゃない、仲間の光を\n受けてまぶしく輝くもの」という結論に達す\nる。一方、歩は仲間の様子を見て、自分が\n年上らしい事ができていないと悩み始める。", "zh": "成员们讨论著科学馆之行的感想，\n最终得出了「月亮绝非微弱之光，\n而是借助伙伴的光芒变得更加耀眼」的结论。\n另一方面，步看到伙伴们的样子，\n开始烦恼自己没有尽到年长者的本分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "c2e757b163825a2576f44e3d0949eb52ed7d6b17ebbf675509dc5434cbb43c8f", "ja": "……準備運動、終わりっと。よし！\n今日も気合い入れて頑張ろう！", "zh": "……暖身运动，结束。\n好！今天也要努力加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "fd0a2564b376994874319b9c28ef0d09b08d5531180c3404cd6528f2272de089", "ja": "おはようございます。\n紗代子さんも自主練ですか？", "zh": "早安。\n纱代子，你也来自主练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "60712be3545dbc368589187f10fc5fec8c902ff0b9c7733d0d10daae78c203ec", "ja": "はっ！？　お、おはよう！　静香ちゃんも？\nふふっ、さすが、気合い十分だね！", "zh": "啊！？早、早安！静香也是吗？\n呵呵！看来你也干劲十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "95905f7a9c5aee8d94508f43d9a9abf0fbed2b6e9801fd237e6b49c841d4c5a8", "ja": "はい。昨日、みんなで科学館に行ったあと、\n自分でもいろいろと考えてみて……。", "zh": "是的，昨天大家一起去完科学馆之后，\n我自己也想了很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "811bc793bb0004b5e6d1e78abbdf11830942179b2e9d7bcb1b6b7cdc1ac30745", "ja": "少し、見えてきた気がするんです。\n私、月のイメージが単純すぎたのかもって……。", "zh": "现在我似乎有点头绪了。\n或许我之前对月亮的印象太过单纯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "bbd350bdf42a7444b1b9e8963229354bf5889be7a94cfcb844eac1d0137a38a1", "ja": "月のイメージ……それって、前に千鶴さん達と話した\n月らしさの表現のこと？", "zh": "对月亮的印象……你是指上次和千鹤姊她们讨论的，\n如何表现出月亮的印象吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "0f6dd9aba4d3ef193d94feb35b8f620a2360493b2ca6161aace965b9e8871178", "ja": "はい。月は自分だけでは輝けない、だから弱い、\nはかないって……そう繋げてしまっていました。", "zh": "是啊，月亮无法独力发光，\n所以是微弱、飘渺的……那时我们是这样联想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "83576a42bc104e07c4497275c0250194518e58a253a00a93fe39c1b62a820956", "ja": "でも昨日、麗花さんが「みんなと一緒に来られて\n楽しかった」って、言ってくれましたよね？", "zh": "但是昨天，丽花姊不是说了，\n「和大家一起来很开心」吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "db05ea6fa0f75ffaa364f1098b651150fa224705f90fbbdcb61552b9ddf456e7", "ja": "うん。前からみんなで来たかった、って。", "zh": "嗯，她说一直很想和大家一起去玩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "c0f46c3a43433880c9446f69f5d3ac9649779c880eca1ae8a0f9ae718e370712", "ja": "それって、きっとみんなの楽しさが集まって、大きく\nなったり、高め合ったりするからなのかな、って……。", "zh": "我在想，那一定是因为大家的欢乐聚集在一起，\n变得更大、互相增幅了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "be30b35e8dbda40581a366e9d93ec1fcf6e80b86225dfdb5d597012d284cead2", "ja": "そしたら、月の光も同じに思えて来たんです。\n仲間の光をもらって、集まって……。", "zh": "然后，我就想到月光也是一样的。\n借助伙伴的光芒，聚集起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "77c9f9eb326ba8c1b4d2345ac436e279c637c2a1093ebddbd9e0c863efe87c58", "ja": "そしたら、月はどこまでも輝けるんだなって……。\nあっ、ごめんなさい。私、変なこと言ってますか？", "zh": "这么一来，月亮就能持续不断地散发光芒……\n啊！抱歉，我是不是讲了很奇怪的话？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "8ab46e94153dc86642d5b364d6d2404646f4ba79c46145ad89c685b4fac36b9d", "ja": "そんなことないよ！　みんなの光をもらって輝く。\n……うん、すごく月らしくて、いいイメージだと思う！", "zh": "不会啊！借助大家的光芒来闪耀……\n嗯，这样的印象很有月亮的感觉，我觉得很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "8f3417151660f2998f37bec85ddba54ab2288d21acf721298354949d15d9b825", "ja": "そ、そうですよね？　よかった……。", "zh": "你、你也这么想吗？太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "80f24b4e9d78e8eb5e97dbb4c6256e4c0eea45d85cb432747c67f23c0f257e73", "ja": "あ、だから私もメンバーの一員として、みなさんに光を\n届けられるように、しっかり練習するつもりです！", "zh": "啊，所以身为团体的一员，为了让大家能接收到光芒，\n我想要好好地练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "fb7badee09aee47a71a51c852fea794034b6d8a2b8fe743f61fb6497b6b0e716", "ja": "うん、一緒にがんばろう！\n私も静香ちゃんと同じ気持ちだからね！", "zh": "嗯，一起加油吧！\n静香，我的想法也和你一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "79515488f5dacea215e334c9beb33d60dbbc6e2b64a61c13349f9957a9903aef", "ja": "えっ。紗代子さんも、昨日の科学館で？", "zh": "咦？纱代子，你昨天在科学馆也这么想吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "6564e644f3f0deb969227a8b9cfc2b204f372c7fdb9eba1dce0e556bdaab4fdb", "ja": "うん……。じつは私も、ちょっと悩んでたの。\n月の優雅さなんて、私に表現できるのかな……って。", "zh": "嗯……其实我也烦恼了一阵子。\n担心我能不能表现出月亮的优雅……这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "d20eb379cc77ed4c10022c4963e57b93b96ebe545c843ac4ca36d65a14dc826c", "ja": "優雅ではかなくて、凛としてクールで……。", "zh": "优雅而飘渺、凛然而沉着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "a68614b45ebc0b6b000d9d9fab158914f2a01a007862eb02ef195df5262784fa", "ja": "静香ちゃん達にはピッタリなイメージだよね。\nだから余計に、弱気になっちゃってたのかな？", "zh": "静香你们都很符合这些印象。\n所以才更使得我感到畏缩吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "0d5e7d9881ad642dc8a4601a03c5fa88b41b820af47964037e3be5905bb79de8", "ja": "そんな！　紗代子さんこそオトナで凛としてて、\nすごくその……キレイじゃないですか？", "zh": "怎么会呢！？纱代子才是，既成熟又有自信，\n非常地、那个……非常地漂亮不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "ab955d06ef6329c4d01032ab956cc9cb5f7b8550018ad54e14eaa6e1e0da7928", "ja": "ふふっ……ありがとう！\nそう言ってもらえると、素直にうれしいな！", "zh": "呵呵……谢谢你！\n听到你这么说，我真的很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "6fd25ced40644a66da97e167fd01f9aee1c85884e6e5f3ad0ba683d97e67f71f", "ja": "でも、できないことも自分で分かってるから。\n歌にしろ、ダンスにしろ……。", "zh": "不过，我也很清楚自己做不到哪些事。\n无论是唱歌、还是跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "d1ac4d406501a5aeb7b47e0a8cf5d505ede9a58f68bacaf45a493b0a04b4e249", "ja": "私はまだ静香ちゃん達みたいに、\n優雅にもクールにもできてないって。", "zh": "我还无法像静香你们一样，\n既不优雅，也不沉着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "fd615932b9f9f5bbccb3067b0908b336d5cf0b903c9120057b925fb71dfa438e", "ja": "紗代子さん……。", "zh": "纱代子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "ea44333eb4f69e097d50c3d5ca784117a4f69c0a82a6ebb3b20d4be5c13699b5", "ja": "でもね。だから私は、みんなを追いかけて走るよ！\nみんなと一緒に、憧れを追いかけるから！", "zh": "不过呢，我会努力追上大家的！\n然后继续和大家一起追求憧憬的事物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "77afbcf8990588aa16af9e4321d99438f0ddcf7fc6804f1b6b66d58d1c808296", "ja": "ほら、{$P$}も言ってたでしょ？\n『brave HARMONY』は、月への憧れの歌だって！", "zh": "你想想，{$P$}不也说过吗？\n『brave HARMONY』这首歌表达的是对月亮的憧憬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "65fb8317afe87058ff2ed3842f1b6f432024e52fdb231c35b2e590a058b2b484", "ja": "やっぱり、紗代子さんはすごいです。\n強くて、こんなにも周りに力をくれて……。", "zh": "纱代子，你真的好厉害。\n你好坚强，又能带给周遭这么大的鼓励……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "4033f7bc10a71757238076d1476342b303b051b65d4bdcf0b30f4521b47b6110", "ja": "ふふっ、静香ちゃんの力になれるなら、私も追いかける\n甲斐があるかな。みんなで一緒に頑張ろうね！", "zh": "呵呵！如果能鼓励到静香，那也不枉费我追赶在后了。\n大家一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "ec1fc83d5b6a69076b03dfe13f81f39f2500359398e9b3ac6311626b4cf12c4a", "ja": "はいっ。みんなで一緒に頑張って、光を集めて。\n太陽よりもまぶしい満月になってみせましょう！", "zh": "好的！大家一起努力聚集光芒，\n成为比太阳更加耀眼的满月吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "eb4936395c5915125edd4c6c724408d585c95f5a5ea9cc0c0a079490951ddba9", "ja": "（今日の仕事は、公演の準備と外回りと……。\nうん？　あそこにいるのは……）", "zh": "（今天的工作是准备公演和跑业务……\n嗯？那是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1032_027say", "source_sha256": "8fbad004309819e2fa68e9f4e568b12295f203a34d66bc7f19211e8f07857967", "ja": "……あっ、{$P$}、\nおはようございます！　……あれ、みんなも？", "zh": "……啊！{$P$}，早安！\n……咦？大家也在？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "998bf6dc2e341acb3f8a9d10cc2280df0f82b3dc2cb927e972ef9b8446d2c725", "ja": "お、おはようございますっ。", "zh": "早、早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "7ed99c81c7a2d8358a6f430059e702780fce4daf0c7c556ab9735a02905333a6", "ja": "やっほ～♪\n今日も空に飛び出したくなる朝ですねっ♪", "zh": "嗨～♪\n今天早上也令人想飞上天呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1035_031tom", "source_sha256": "9ae01ee6784ef2b946a1c2886283e6e432f5a8ce54860febee5a034870959b62", "ja": "みなさん、\nおはようございます～。", "zh": "各位，\n大家早～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2cf9eb8112dc802e826a1b7ab18035f0ce24a258134483c442255d17a8f4835e", "ja": "ふたりして、何を盛り上がってたんだ？", "zh": "你们俩聊什么聊得这么起劲啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1037_027say", "source_sha256": "1bd15449e570d668d5b729169c93c7f6152be3bb82dddb66e920519a1c7f7941", "ja": "ふふっ。昨日、麗花さんが私達を連れ出してくれたおか\nげで、大事なことに気づけたかもっていうお話です♪", "zh": "呵呵！昨天丽花姊带我们出去，\n我们觉得多亏这样才能发现重要的事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "b3d891a8d29940f395f6a7a455cf9635c806bc4166f022bcdf37d86b9396ee72", "ja": "えっ、何、何？\n今日も遊びに行こうってこと？　賛成っ♪", "zh": "咦？什么什么？\n所以今天也要去玩吗？我赞成♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "93ef5131b1f1109d229d719879f373e3e47222615028df74c60fd11802021e66", "ja": "そ、それは反対ですっ！　昨日の経験を活かして、\n今日はしっかり頑張った方が……。", "zh": "我、我反对！我们要活用昨天的经验，\n今天好好加油才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1040_027say", "source_sha256": "bbd0b752c8718633673118620cbadabb5a2f0572b218c457aa7ff37eb58460b4", "ja": "麗花さん、昨日は本当に楽しかったし、タメにも\nなりました。だからこそ、今日はレッスンで！", "zh": "丽花姊，昨天真的玩得很开心，也有很多收获。\n正因为这样，今天要努力练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "c38723e6b55afe8dbd5ae6b9ad6693c2088ac6393dcebc2e0f5c39cf0d0f85ae", "ja": "はーい、それにも賛成です♪\nレッスンも、みんなと一緒だと楽しいよね♪", "zh": "好～这个我也赞成♪\n练习也是大家一起做才比较开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1042_031tom", "source_sha256": "b10c7fc08f5f6e1d83089faa465e48d6f54009c65dc22f4004f86560a3c5177f", "ja": "では、後でレッスンルームに集合ですね。\n麗花さん、歩さん、私達も着替えましょう～。", "zh": "那么，待会就到练习室集合吧。\n丽花姊、步姊，我们也去换衣服吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1043_034ayu", "source_sha256": "74bc2fe360295dbfa8dd22a7af73850ed0b5c07ccdd01597d8bdf8eab1673567", "ja": "やっぱスゴイよな、麗花って。\nさり気なく、いい空気にしてくれるっていうかさ！", "zh": "丽花她真的好厉害喔。\n能够若无其事地营造出好气氛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1044_034ayu", "source_sha256": "42edd0cf3f8e47d80865da8a20f2dae5e45711b92fbaaf4701f65e261a203fe9", "ja": "ほんと、いいメンバーだよ。静香も朋花も、\n中学生なのにしっかりしてるし。紗代子も熱心だし！", "zh": "我们的团员真的很棒耶。静香和朋花虽然还是国中生，\n却都很懂事。纱代子也很积极投入！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1045_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3d69d8902a9e3a6418dc76cec4c3c4e511cbf80ec8915fa138dd599ea84561a8", "ja": "……あれ？　{$P$}。\nアタシにもあるかなぁ。なんか、そういう……。", "zh": "……咦？{$P$}，\n我也有吗？有没有什么优点之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1046_p", "source_sha256": "c45c2311b26e06b409aa7240c59457c99af86512278c7bc0ec422e99cfc6c2a3", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ、急に？", "zh": "嗯？你怎么突然这么问？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1047_034ayu", "source_sha256": "78abe8bd64d374850b8fd44d3d6b583dd71e33523a4c0bd31a5cd4327b047fdc", "ja": "ほら、アタシ、今回のメンツじゃ上から二番目じゃん？\nでも、それらしいコト、できてないような……？", "zh": "你想想，我的年纪在这次的成员里头是第二大的耶。\n但我好像没做什么年长的人该做的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1048_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7135f756e99c4c0a8223817a9ca7cc2105742e81fdd3919d0f6249e9ecd33f31", "ja": "ああ～、やっぱりいいや。ゴメン、ヘンなこと聞いて！\nよしっ、アタシも行ってくるね！", "zh": "啊啊～还是当我没说吧。抱歉，问你奇怪的问题！\n好！我也要去换衣服了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_04_1049_p", "source_sha256": "376ecab85389cb23102fc35b5c14b3bda6564716c91ec5a000744ad968f2c0bb", "ja": "あ、ああ、頑張ってこい！", "zh": "好、好的，加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
